            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Hold My Notes 1.0.0</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed automatic updates failing with "An error occurred while running the updater" — the sandboxed installer service is now bundled and signed correctly</li>
<li>Update dialogs now show what changed in each release</li>
<li>The note editor's Pin moved to the top right as a real pin, with Mark complete and Close along the bottom</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
